WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.890
Take the green winder out of the camera.

2
00:00:02.890 --> 00:00:06.040
Fit its fork over the bar in the open end of the film.

3
00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:10.253
Now turn the winder: the spool inside the film turns with it.

4
00:00:10.253 --> 00:00:11.248
Wrong end?

5
00:00:11.248 --> 00:00:14.033
The other end of the film has a peg sticking out.

6
00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:17.248
The fork straddles a bar inside the film's spool,

7
00:00:17.248 --> 00:00:20.588
so from now on this winder turns the film's own spool.

